{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_10_end",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_10",
  "title": "Goodbye, Goodbye",
  "storyCode": "BB-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "79ee6182bb0da31a41da6e211a6cd21174458318c23132c07d8817a57a8f08e4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Theresa holds the hands of the one before her, as if it were their first meeting.\nShe quietly faces the other pair of eyes, looking at the emotions shifting within until finally, only a void remains.\nShe knows then, every memory has been wiped clean, the soul purified."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your memory is gone, and your soul reborn..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A truly terrible trick..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But they underestimate your benevolence, your desire for victory. They underestimate us, and what makes Terra so tenacious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctor. Allow me to call you by this name for the last time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is my little revenge on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And also... my final gift to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Memory does not shape who you are. So, with your original self..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Live again... on this land. See the world, feel the various emotions life brings, meet the many people of Terra..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perhaps... your journey will start in suffering, and you may never manage to escape the murky moon shadows of this land, but you will always... get to see the sun rise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I trust you will find a new solution. One that is truly your own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An answer that... sounds just like the murmur Kal'tsit and I once heard..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A most moving answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Life slips away.\nHer ears gradually pick up an elegy from afar. Laqeramaline did establish a connection with her after all.\nTheresa feels her own breath growing feebler, but she also feels unprecedentedly relieved.\nShe tries her best to keep Amiya in her arms, protected. Amiya's heartbeat calms her own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm... a little tired. It's exhausting, holding onto that crown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I should rest when I'm tired. Isn't that right, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I once imagined that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perhaps, one day... We'll be able to let everyone on this vast land fall into peaceful slumber."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It may take a long time to come, but maybe, you could see it for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya, when you wake up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You'll have to keep going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*—I'm so tired..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, she's not here yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She clings to her final strand of remaining strength.\nShe is waiting for someone she must see.\nFortunately, the sound of her footsteps already draws near."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And then finally, even though she no longer has the strength to keep her eyes open, she knows—\nShe is here—\nKal'tsit...\nKal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theresa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya... Doctor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I knew full well this possibility always existed... Why...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I should have stayed behind—it's my..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The...resa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... We should have..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theresa... confirmed... dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr, heed my command..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Prepare... for any follow up attacks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Doctor and Amiya... nothing must happen to them. Protect them at all costs!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Amiya opens her eyes, pink rhombuses faintly visible in her pupils.\nTheresa's eyes remain shut tight.\nBut Kal'tsit knows.\nIt's her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit... I've been waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theresa! I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's alright, Kal'tsit. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Listen to me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm already dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What you see now is my consciousness put into the crown. I'm borrowing the body of this girl to bid you farewell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, tell me. Did you raise Babel's banner high up in the sky over Kazdel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I sent it back to Kazdel, and watched it ascend myself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I came back too late, I knew there might be a possibility..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't blame yourself for this, Kal'tsit. You had your own mission to fulfil."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And... I managed to hold this long for you, and that's enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Are we, running out of time to say our goodbyes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please don't blame yourself for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We trusted the Doctor, and I hope you can continue on our path into the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, there's no need for any further misgivings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I took a life, but I also saved it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So please, take it to where it should be, if it can wake again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guide it, and it will in turn lead us to the end of our path—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have no doubt about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However... we can no longer take the risk of venturing into... the depths of Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will entrust someone I know to send the Doctor to Ursus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Chernobog will be safe. It is too... dangerous to allow the Doctor to stay on Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's good... Kal'tsit. I'll leave the rest to Amiya then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She will walk a difficult road."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will be with her, and Babel... as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is so young, but so strong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, giving the crown to Babel... to her, I did not do this on a selfish whim."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To break the cycle and deal with what is to come... The King cannot only be a King of the Sarkaz, nor can it only be a King of Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The role is no fetter, controller, or unparalleled power."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The role is a key. The King is... 'Civilight Eterna'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Kal'tsit, keep this a secret from Amiya. She doesn't need to bear all of that now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She will understand once she embarks on that path, she <i>needs</i> to understand—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Only by overcoming every obstacle can we find the doors that lead to this world."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...And you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will be gone in the pursuit of my ideal. As for her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Amiya'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She will become the flame that burns all corruption to ashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is leaving us."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "While you will become the final struggle for her ideals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A last-ditch effort."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Deathmongers—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do not attempt to abandon your efforts, before her end is set..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Prove to me that her path still holds the chance to win a future—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Prove to her the peace you strive for is still worth a response."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Though I regret to say this, my compatriots..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The call to repay this blood debt is already resonating throughout this great land—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her death has been determined."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have lost a Sarkaz King."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have lost my only kin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I will not let these sacrifices be in vain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My people—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
